9 0 obj
<< /Length 479 >>
stream
BT /F1 20 Tf 72 720 Td (Campus Wayfinding Study) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 72 688 Td (Overview) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 662 Td (Students and visitors navigate using signage, mobile maps, and habit.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 646 Td (Prior work suggests people scan for a single confirming detail.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 630 Td (This study asks where that scanning breaks down, and whether the) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 614 Td (failures cluster in places that can be predicted in advance.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
10 0 obj
<< /Length 486 >>
stream
BT /F1 20 Tf 72 720 Td (Scope and Definitions) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 688 Td (A junction is any point offering two or more onward paths.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 672 Td (A backtrack is a return to a previously visited junction.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 656 Td (First correct turn is the first heading change that reduces) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 640 Td (remaining distance to the stated destination.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 624 Td (Outdoor routing and emergency egress are out of scope.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
11 0 obj
<< /Length 484 >>
stream
BT /F1 20 Tf 72 720 Td (Methods) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 72 688 Td (Participants and procedure) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 662 Td (Twenty-four participants, none familiar with the study building.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 646 Td (Four timed trials each, destinations presented in random order.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 630 Td (Participants thought aloud while a researcher logged junction events.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 614 Td (Audio was transcribed and coded for expressions of uncertainty.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
12 0 obj
<< /Length 526 >>
stream
BT /F1 20 Tf 72 720 Td (Findings) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 72 688 Td (Where navigation failed) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 662 Td (Median time to first correct turn was eleven seconds.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 646 Td (The distribution was strongly right skewed at the entrance junction.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 630 Td (Backtracking concentrated at three junctions, all unsigned, all) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 614 Td (offering three or more onward paths.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 598 Td (Two-path junctions produced almost no backtracking.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
13 0 obj
<< /Length 331 >>
stream
BT /F1 20 Tf 72 720 Td (The Single Sign Intervention) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 688 Td (One directional sign at the worst junction halved backtracks there.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 672 Td (The effect did not transfer to other junctions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 656 Td (This supports a decision-point account over signage quantity.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
14 0 obj
<< /Length 306 >>
stream
BT /F1 20 Tf 72 720 Td (Limitations) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 688 Td (One building, twenty-four participants, one signage style.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 672 Td (Think-aloud protocols may themselves slow navigation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 72 656 Td (We did not test whether the effect survives familiarity.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
